                            /** @description The daily window sync reads happen in, in the account's time zone, which follows where the account connects (the same zone fields as the account's activity_window). Reads start a little after start and stop a little before end, varying by day. Null when sync is not reading for this account (disabled, tier_required, account_unavailable). */
